.TH AWS-LC-BSSL 1 "November 2026" "aws-lc 5.12.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aws-lc-bssl \- BoringSSL-style command line tool built on AWS-LC
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aws-lc-bssl
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aws-lc-bssl
is the BoringSSL
.B bssl
tool as shipped by AWS-LC, for testing TLS connections, measuring
performance and computing digests. Run it without arguments to list the
commands.
.PP
Commands: ciphers, client, isfips, generate-ech, generate-ed25519, genrsa,
md5sum, pkcs12, rand, s_client, s_server, server, sha1sum, sha224sum,
sha256sum, sha384sum, sha512sum, sha512256sum, sign, speed, version.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aws-lc-openssl (1)
